B.c9N=new A.h('ValidationMode controls when a validator RUNS. showErrors on FormField controls when errors are DISPLAYED. Even if a validator runs on initial mode and finds an error, the error won\'t show if showErrors only contains {changed, submitted}. These are independent settings that work together. See the "Show Errors vs Validation Mode" section above for a detailed example.',null,null,null,null,null,null)
